直接可以尝试&lt;code&gt;file&lt;/code&gt;协议
&lt;img alt=&#34;image.png&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://jerry-note-imgs.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/imgs/202502101735588.png&#34;&gt;
